  "job_B15.3.39_20251003_114324": {
    "text": "\u00c6t Bradingccotan, Godingce & \u00e6t Genenofre.\nIc Osuuald \u00feur Godes giefe arcebisceop mid ge\u00feafunge & leafe \u00c6\u00feelredes Angulcyningces & \u00c6lfrices\n& \u00fe\u00e6rto ic him sylle VII \u00e6cras m\u00e6due on \u00fe\u00e6m homme \u00fee gebyra\u00f0 into Tidbrihtingctune, feor\u00fee halfne\nEac we writa\u00f0 him \u00feone hagan \u00fee he h\u00e6f\u00f0 beforan \u00fe\u00e6m gete & twam yrfweardum \u00e6fter his d\u00e6ge.\n\u00deis sindon \u00fe\u00e6ra \u00fereora hida landgem\u00e6ru to Bradingccotan.\n\u00de\u00e6t is \u00feonne \u00e6rest of calawan hylle on foreweardan \u00fe\u00e6re aldan dic.\nAndlang \u00fe\u00e6re aldan dic to \u00fe\u00e6re m\u00e6re stowe.\nOf \u00fe\u00e6re m\u00e6re stowe \u00fe\u00e6t in \u00fea dic.\nAndlang \u00fe\u00e6re dic \u00fe\u00e6t to \u00fe\u00e6re saltstr\u00e6te.\nSwa west ofer \u00fe\u00e6re str\u00e6te in \u00fea hegestowe to Sp\u00e6ch\u00e6me gem\u00e6re.\nOf Sp\u00e6ch\u00e6me gem\u00e6re be westan oxnaleage be \u00fe\u00e6m hli\u00fee.\nOf oxna leage nor\u00f0 in \u00fea hegestowe.\nAndlang \u00fe\u00e6re hegestowe to \u00fe\u00e6m fulan slo.\nOf \u00fe\u00e6m fulan slo in \u00fea dic.\nOf \u00fe\u00e6re dic to wynne m\u00e6duan be \u00fe\u00e6re str\u00e6t.\nAndlang str\u00e6te \u00fe\u00e6t to \u00fe\u00e6m lytlan hylle.\nOf \u00fe\u00e6m hylle \u00fe\u00e6t swa be \u00fe\u00e6m IIII \u00feornan.\nOf \u00fe\u00e6m \u00feornan be \u00fe\u00e6m heafdon to \u00fe\u00e6m \u00feornihtan heafodlonde.\nOf \u00fe\u00e6m heafodlonde to \u00fe\u00e6re hegestowe.\nAndlang \u00fe\u00e6re hegestowe to Huniburnan.\nAndlang Huniburnan to \u00fe\u00e6re dic.\nOf \u00fe\u00e6re dic to \u00fe\u00e6m lytlan slo.\nOf \u00fe\u00e6m slo to \u00fe\u00e6re aldan dic.\nAndlang \u00fe\u00e6re dic to \u00fe\u00e6m h\u00e6\u00fee foreweardan.\nSwa su\u00f0 andlang \u00fe\u00e6re lytlan dic \u00fe\u00e6t.\n\u00deonne westweard ofer \u00feone h\u00e6\u00f0 to \u00fe\u00e6m lytlan grafe.\nOf \u00fe\u00e6m grafe su\u00f0weard beastan \u00fe\u00e6m wulfsea\u00f0e.\nAndlang \u00fe\u00e6re stige \u00fe\u00e6t eft to calawan hylle to \u00fe\u00e6re dic foreweardan.\nSit autem terra illa libera ab omni secularis rei negotio preter pontis et arcis restaurationem et contra\nSancta Maria & sanctus (35) Michahel cum sancto Petro & allum Godes halgum gemiltien \u00feis\nGief hwa butan gewrihtum hit abrecan wille h\u00e6bbe him wid God gem\u00e6ne on \u00feam ytemestan d\u00e6g\n\u00d0is is seo hondseten.",
